msgstr "Hết sạch trơn rồi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY"
