msgstr "Xung quanh không có tuyết."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG"
