msgstr "Sắp tắt rồi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL"
