#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2"
